# AUTHORED_NOT_RUN. milestone_0030 N5 + N6-a (DESIGN 13.3, 14.3, 14.8 steps 2-4): the build profile,
# manifest and invocation contracts, the input-manifest digest, explicit arm selection, the
# remote-build request projection / created-config / Create argv, the binding digest (agent golden +
# build kind/key), the enable window and the machine-policy fixed-child allow-list. DATA only:
# no native custody, owner or grant is fabricated here.
# @req REQ-M0030-N5-BUILD-PROFILE
# @req REQ-M0030-N6A-REMOTE-BUILD-ARM
